to the 2007–2017 NDI to search for potential matches\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Multivariable-adjusted risk ratios examining factors associated with mortality were estimated using a Poisson regression model\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"were used to calculate SMRs using indirect age standardization in 11 age groups\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Two-sided hypothesis tests were conducted controlling for the type I error rate at 5%\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"CIs are calculated for each estimated SMR by assuming a Poisson distribution.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}